  "components.help.importAttach": "Import copies a file from your device to “Imports telephone” in the project on the PC. Attach adds a file or excerpt to the next message without sending it. “Import and attach” combines these steps. A message accepts up to four usable attachments.",
  "components.help.supportedFiles": "Text files, PDFs, DOCX and XLSX containing text can be attached depending on extraction results. If extraction is partial, select a passage in the preview. To analyze an image, choose a model marked Vision; attaching an image does not generate a new ComfyUI image.",
  "components.help.projectFiles": "In “Project files”, you can view files, edit supported text files and find deliverables and trash. PDFs, DOCX and XLSX are shown as extracted text; direct tools do not edit their original formats.",
  "components.help.filePermissions": "In Tools, “None”, “Read” and “Write” control the model’s direct tools. A new regular chat starts in Write mode: check this before sending. In this mode, allowed writes happen immediately without approval for each file. Successful actions may offer a comparison, restore or previous version, provided the file has not changed. Keep independent backups.",
  "components.help.checkPermissions": "Check tool permissions",
  "components.help.toolsTitle": "Internet and scripts: choose what you allow",
  "components.help.fixedPermissions": "Permissions are independent and fixed for each message when accepted. Changing them later applies to future requests. A model response claiming to have acted does not replace the result of an action in the conversation.",
  "components.help.webTitle": "Search and read the Internet",
  "components.help.webHelp": "The PC sends searches to the configured engine and reads public pages. Your browser accounts and cookies are not sent. Search terms and URLs leave the PC: avoid including secrets. “Approve each search and URL before sending” shows each exact request before approval.",
  "components.help.scriptTitle": "Run a script",
  "components.help.scriptApproval": "The Scripts option lets the model propose Python, Node.js or PowerShell code. Each proposal waits for your approval of the exact code in the chat. Read it before choosing “Run this script” or “Reject”.",
  "components.help.scriptPermissions": "An approved script runs with the PC account permissions: it is not a sandbox. It can act outside the project and use the network even when file or Internet tools are disabled. Stopping it or an error does not undo its changes.",
  "components.help.nextMessageTools": "Set tools for the next message",
  "components.help.imagesTitle": "Set up and use ComfyUI images",
  "components.help.comfyServer": "Start ComfyUI, then open Images and ComfyUI. “Find server” checks ports 8188 and 8000 on the companion PC and the entered address; it does not scan the whole network. For another port or PC, enter the address reachable from the companion PC.",
  "components.help.comfyModels": "Choose Krea 2 Turbo or Hassaku XL Illustrious v34, then test the connection and models. Diagnostics distinguish the server, missing models and missing nodes without rendering. Install required components in ComfyUI; the companion does not download models automatically.",
  "components.help.comfyEnable": "Choose memory cleanup, enable ComfyUI and save. Testing uses your inputs without saving them. In message Tools, allow images, choose the profile and request an image from a model supporting tool calls.",
  "components.help.comfyWorkflows": "The supplied workflows are fixed: the companion does not use the graph open in ComfyUI. Configure two optional LoRAs per profile in Images and ComfyUI; being listed does not guarantee compatibility. The profile, LoRAs and cleanup are fixed for the sent message.",
  "components.help.memoryTitle": "What is optional memory cleanup for?",
  "components.help.memoryBenefit": "“Unload ComfyUI models after each render” may free memory for other applications or help with slowdowns between renders, especially with Krea 2. Weights must be reloaded for the next render, which may be slower. No speed gain or amount of freed memory is guaranteed.",
  "components.help.memoryInstall": "Leave this option disabled to use ComfyUI without the memory module. To enable it, download the supplied module from settings, copy it to the custom_nodes folder of the ComfyUI instance in use, then restart that instance after its work finishes. Diagnostics also check module compatibility with SaveImage.",
  "components.help.memoryTiming": "Cleanup happens after the workflow, not systematically before every prompt. It does not unload the Bionic chat model. Images arrive in the chat through the companion; the phone does not need direct access to ComfyUI.",
  "components.help.comfySettings": "Open ComfyUI settings",
  "components.help.memorySettings": "Choose memory cleanup",
  "components.help.connectionTitle": "Phone connection and security",
  "components.help.connectionHelp": "Use the companion on a trusted local network. With HTTP, the access code, messages and files are not encrypted in transit. Security and access lets you prepare HTTPS, then a certificate for each device with mTLS.",
  "components.help.trustHelp": "Trusting the authority and importing a certificate require actions in your device system settings. Compare the fingerprint with the one shown on the PC, then verify the connection before confirming the new level. Do not bypass a certificate warning.",
  "components.help.sharedAccess": "Authorized devices share the same access scope: there are no separate accounts or roles. Keep the access code and companion data private. Do not expose its server directly to the Internet.",
  "components.help.connectionSettings": "Open Security and access",
  "components.help.troubleshootingTitle": "Troubleshoot a problem",
  "components.help.modelProblem": "The model does not respond: check that Bionic and its local API are running on the PC, then open connection diagnostics. It sends no message and starts no model. “Reconnect to PC” also rereads projects and conversations.",
  "components.help.toolProblem": "A tool does not work: check the project, model compatibility and permissions for the message. Look at the action result in the conversation; a script or web request may be waiting for your approval.",
  "components.help.serverProblem": "ComfyUI cannot be found: check that it is running and verify its address and port. For another PC, check its network listener and private-network firewall. A search with no results does not prove that the server option is disabled.",
  "components.help.imageProblem": "An image “needs checking” after a delay or disconnection: check ComfyUI before repeating the request. The companion does not automatically resubmit an uncertain generation. Stopping the chat response does not stop all ComfyUI jobs.",
  "components.help.fileProblem": "An attached file has changed: remove it and attach its new version. After a failed action or script, check the current file before restoring anything.",
  "components.help.connectionDiagnostics": "Open connection diagnostics",
  "components.help.comfyTest": "Test ComfyUI without rendering",
  "components.help.updatesTitle": "Update the companion",
  "components.help.updatesHelp": "In Maintenance, choose the Stable or Beta channel, then check for updates. Beta includes versions being tested. Installation always requires your approval and restarts the companion server; wait for jobs to finish and save your file changes.",
  "components.help.stableReturn": "Returning to the Stable channel does not reinstall an older version: the companion waits for a newer stable release. If automatic installation is unavailable, the panel explains why. “Later” and “Ignore this version” do not install anything.",
  "components.help.updatesSettings": "Open updates",
